# Build and run the hxSockets test suite on the C++ (hxcpp) target.
# This is the primary target for the library (a sys/C++ library) and is the one
# that exercises the mTLS, manual-poll, framed-read and receive-buffer tests.
#
#   haxe tests_cpp.hxml
#
# Requires: haxe, the utest and hxcpp haxelibs, a working C++ toolchain, and
# (for the mTLS tests only) an `openssl` binary on PATH. When openssl is absent
# the mTLS tests SKIP rather than fail.
-debug
-lib utest
-lib hxcpp
-cp src
-cp tests
-main hxSockets.tests.HaxeSocketTests
-cpp tests/cpp
-cmd echo "Running C++ tests..." && tests/cpp/HaxeSocketTests-debug
